        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Sisters (2005 film)\n- People: Eric McCormack, Maria Bello, Mary Stuart Masterson, Erika Christensen, Alessandro Nivola, Rip Torn, Steven Culp, Tony Goldwyn, Chris O'Donnell\n- Roles: Will Truman, Dr. Daniel Pierce\n- Topics: film casts, television acting careers\n\nFacts:\n- Eric James McCormack was born on April 18, 1963, and he is a Canadian-American actor.\n- Eric McCormack is known for playing Will Truman in the American sitcom \"Will & Grace\".\n- Eric McCormack is also known for playing Dr. Daniel Pierce in the American crime drama \"Perception\".\n- The Sisters is a 2005 film starring Maria Bello, Mary Stuart Masterson, and Erika Christensen as the title characters.\n- The 2005 film The Sisters also stars Alessandro Nivola, Rip Torn, Eric McCormack, Steven Culp, Tony Goldwyn, and Chris O'Donnell.",
